           "text": "Business Package FAQs",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "heading",
           "level": "h3",
           "text": "What is included in the Logo Austin Business Starter Package?",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "text",
           "html": "<p>For $950 you get a custom logo (JPG and PNG), a basic single-page responsive website, 150 business cards, Google Business Profile setup, a free domain and hosting for one year, Google Search Console submission and free website maintenance for the first year.</p>",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "heading",
           "level": "h3",
           "text": "Are there yearly fees?",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "text",
           "html": "<p>From the second year, website maintenance is $250 per year and an optional yearly backup is $50. There are no hidden charges.</p>",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "heading",
           "level": "h3",
           "text": "Is there a contract?",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "text",
           "html": "<p>No. There is no contract, and you can stop working with Logo Austin at any time.</p>",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "heading",
           "level": "h3",
           "text": "Can I pay in installments?",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "text",
           "html": "<p>Yes. Logo Austin offers an installment option for small businesses.</p>",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "heading",
           "level": "h3",
           "text": "Does the package include an online store?",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "text",
           "html": "<p>No, but the starter website can be converted to e-commerce whenever you are ready.</p>",
